{
  "note": [
    "Bluesky accounts belonging to the dev team, mixed into every generated",
    "fixture by default (generate_sample.py --no-dev-users opts out).",
    "",
    "Without this, signing into a devenv frontend as yourself gives an empty,",
    "unpersonalized feed: the fixture's like graph is sampled from whoever was",
    "most active on Bluesky that day, which is never us. Including these DIDs",
    "in the sample cohort pulls each account's real like history into the",
    "fixture, so the user tower has something to encode when you log in.",
    "",
    "To add someone, append an entry with just a handle — the generator",
    "resolves the DID at generation time and prints it to paste back here.",
    "Handles change and DIDs don't, so the DID is what actually matters; the",
    "handle is documentation.",
    "",
    "Source of the original list: greenearth-social/api#251."
